  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twungurane Coffee Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Coffee).Beneficiaries: Coffee Farmers in Burundi.Summary: Project funds will be used to expand production by increasing the number of drying yards and storage capacity and establishing a rotating crop purchase fund; expanding the capacity of the washing station; providing lighting for the compound for extended working hours and security; and acquiring a truck and motorcycle for transportation. Project funds will also be used for various agricultural and administrative capacity building trainings, for technical staff salaries, and for initial project start-up costs.</narrative>
  </description>
